#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.isdigit:42
msgid ""
"Similar to ``str.isdecimal`` but also includes special digits, like "
"superscripted and subscripted digits in unicode."
msgstr ""
"类似于 ``str.isdecimal`` 但还包括特殊数字，比如 unicode 中的上标和下标数字。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.isdigit:45
msgid ""
"The exact behavior of this method, i.e. which unicode characters are "
"considered as digits, depends on the backend used for string operations, "
"and there can be small differences. For example, Python considers the ³ "
"superscript character as a digit, but not the ⅕ fraction character, while"
" PyArrow considers both as digits. For simple (ascii) decimal numbers, "
"the behaviour is consistent."
msgstr ""
"此方法的确切行为，即哪些 unicode 字符被视为数字，取决于用于字符串操作的后端，并且可能存在小的差异。例如，Python 将 ³ "
"上标字符视为数字，但不将 ⅕ 分数字符视为数字，而 PyArrow 将两者都视为数字。对于简单的 (ascii) 十进制数字，行为是一致的。"

